<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28355" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δραχμ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράσσομαι,</span> prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>as much as one can hold in the hand,</i> cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				17
			</span></i>): </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> a weight,
				<i>drachm,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεῶν</span>]
			prob.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.10.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a silver
			coin, <i>drachma,</i> worth six obols, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				4.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.3171.52
			</span></i> (Orchom. 
				Boeot.
			), <i><span class="en">
				9(1).694.54
			</span></i> (Corc.), etc. [The penult. is long in <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				157
			</span></i>, and sts. in Com., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				691
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				1201
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1019
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				174.17
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαρχμή</span></b>  is found in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαρκνά.</span>]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
